OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785944889
OL,3,CDad of shooting victim says early
OL,4,Crelease scheme 'kick in teeth'
OL,6,FThe father of a beautician who was
OL,7,Fshot outside a pub has said it is a
OL,8,F"massive kick in the teeth" that a man
OL,9,Fwho assisted her murderer will be
OL,10,Feligible for early release.
OL,12,FElle Edwards, 26, was killed by gunman
OL,13,FConnor Chapman, who fired a Skorpion
OL,14,Fsub-machine gun into a group of people
OL,15,Foutside the Lighthouse pub in Wallasey
OL,16,FVillage in Wirral, Merseyside, on
OL,17,FChristmas Eve 2022.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@[O]
