CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785944889
OL,3,CDad of shooting victim says early
OL,4,Crelease scheme 'kick in teeth'
OL,6,FThomas Waring was jailed for nine
OL,7,Fyears in July 2023 after he was found
OL,8,Fguilty of possessing a prohibited
OL,9,Fweapon and assisting an offender by
OL,10,Fhelping Chapman burn out the stolen
OL,11,FMercedes used in the shooting.
OL,13,FTim Edwards, Ellie's dad, said he had
OL,14,Fbeen told Waring would be released in
OL,15,FOctober this year.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785944889
OL,3,CDad of shooting victim says early
OL,4,Crelease scheme 'kick in teeth'
OL,6,FHe said: "It's a massive kick in the
OL,7,Fteeth. I did write to Andy Burnham
OL,8,Flast week and I asked him to just look
OL,9,Fat the criteria that people are going
OL,10,Fto be under or fit to get the early
OL,11,Frelease and there was no response.
OL,13,F"Obviously the reason why was because
OL,14,Fthey were never going to change it.
OL,16,F"I put that more on the Ministry of
OL,17,FJustice because they just won't
OL,18,Fchange, they don't want to change,
OL,19,Fthey're all about number crunching."
OL,26,@nD@JOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785944889
OL,3,CDad of shooting victim says early
OL,4,Crelease scheme 'kick in teeth'
OL,6,FHe said he spoke to a victim liaison
OL,7,Fofficer from the Probation Service
OL,8,Ftold him there would be no change with
OL,9,Fthe early release in Waring's case,
OL,10,Falthough rapists and child sex
OL,11,Foffenders have been made exempt from
OL,12,Fthe scheme.
OL,14,FTim Edwards added: "It just shows that
OL,15,Fthe families, the victims, don't get a
OL,16,Fsay in any of this. It just shows they
OL,17,Fdon't care. It's devastating to take."
OL,26,@vD@TOUyD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
