PN,36605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785944889
OL,3,CDad of shooting victim says early
OL,4,Crelease scheme 'kick in teeth'
OL,6,FLiverpool Crown Court heard Chapman,
OL,7,Fwho was sentenced to life with a
OL,8,Fminimum term of 48 years, went to
OL,9,FWaring's house following the shooting
OL,10,Fand asked him to look after the weapon
OL,11,Fused in the killing.
OL,13,FTim said: "The gun has never been
OL,14,Ffound. That gun is still out there. So
OL,15,Fwhat's to stop him coming out and
OL,16,Fpicking that gun up again, there's
OL,17,Fnothing to stop him doing that, is
OL,18,Fthere?"
OL,26,@uD@KOUzD@GO]
